starter-web-ui
==============

House dashboard UI for STARTER. C/GLib/libsoup serves HTTP; Guile registers
widget types and always draws refresh view-models. Live I/O via
starter-http-bridge; history charts via MySQL (labels/history).

Build
-----

  ./autogen.sh
  ./configure
  make

Run (from build tree)
---------------------

  ./src/starter-web-ui -c examples/web-ui.xml

UI: http://127.0.0.1:18767/

Optional browser auth (username/password + persistent cookie, groups
user|admin) is configured in the daemon XML. Dashboard layout is stored in
data-dir/user-config.xml (empty on first start; edit via the UI as admin).

See doc/starter-web-ui.info.

